'''Spiritual Yulala''' (ネコ神面のウララー, ''Nekoshinmen no Urarā'', '''Divine Cat Mask Urara''' or '''Cat God-Mask Urara''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Mystic Mask Yulala]] introduced on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]] of the [[Infernal Tower]], which unlocks him as [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Masked Yulala]]'s [[True Form]] via [[Catnip Challenges]] when completed. He was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]].

