==Enemy==
Spiritual Yulala is largely the same as the original [[Mystic Mask Yulala]], just with higher health and damage, one less knockback, the Relic trait and a 5-second curse in addition to his warp ability. While having a trait prevents you from using [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Macho Crystal Cat]] or [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Tourist Cat]] to stall him, it's now possible to take off massive chunks of his health pool with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] and freeze him with [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]].

Like with [[Masked Grandmaster Cat (Enemy)|Masked Grandmaster Cat]], the real change in his fight lies in his support. [[Croconator]]s, [[Miz Devil]]s and [[Relic Doge]]s can prove even worse than [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]]'s peons, and that is to say nothing of the [[Lowkey]] that appears after 70 seconds.

